title: KPD Rally
new-page: true

@rally
title: Rally
view-if: {!
    if (Q.labor_minister_party == "KPD" && Q.labor_affairs_post_timer == 0 && Q.strike_term_seen_post_timer == 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.sa_force > 25 && !Q.sa_banned && !Q.return_to_normalcy) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.kpd_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The KPD will hold a rally

- @class_struggle
- @rally_councils
- @rally_pacifism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_wtb
- @rally_local


@sa_disrupt
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the KPD rally!
view-if: {!
    if (Q.labor_minister_party == "KPD" && Q.labor_affairs_timer == 0 && Q.strike_term_seen == 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.sa_force > 25 && !Q.sa_banned && !Q.return_to_normalcy && Q.kpd_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the KPD rally!

- @rfb_protect

@rfb_protect
title: The RFB are sent to protect the rally.
go-to: rfb_protect_win if rfb_success >= 0; rfb_protect_lose if rfb_success < 0

@rfb_protect_win

The Rotfrontkämpfer have successfully protected the KPD's rally against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>! Their meeting can go ahead as usual.

- @class_struggle
- @rally_councils
- @rally_pacifism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_wtb
- @rally_local

@rfb_protect_lose

Unfortunately, the Rotfrontkämpfer was not able to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> mob. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> have won this show of strength.

@class_struggle
title: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
view-if: kpd_leader == "Thälmann"

The KPD's message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Their achievements in nationalization have assisted their messaging. ?]

@rally_councils
title: Rätevernetzung - the expansion and coordination of work councils
view-if: kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and socializations > 0

The KPD's message of solidarity appeals to the organized workers, who seek greater insulation from turbulent market forces. [? if welfare > 1 : Our achievements in socializations have made this message more effective. ?]

@rally_pacifism
title: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs
view-if: kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and not socializations > 0 and not return_to_normalcy

The KPD's speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if kpd_pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult for the KPD to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if kpd_pacifism >= 3 : Since the KPD has consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        if (Q.kpd_wtb_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.wtb_implemented <= Q.kpd_wtb_rally || !Q.kpd_in_government)) {
            return false;
        } else if (Q.kpd_in_government && !Q.nazi_peak_triggered) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The KPD's speakers defend the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> system and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">authoritarians</span> who threaten it.

[? if kpd_democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers as much as more practical issues. But that may change; part of the KPD's job is to provide political education to the proletariat. ?]
[? if kpd_democratization >= 3 : Since the KPD have consistently made democratization a theme of their campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_wtb
title: Support the WTB plan!
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        if (Q.kpd_wtb_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.wtb_implemented <= Q.kpd_wtb_rally || !Q.kpd_in_government)) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for the KPD. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises. [? if not wtb_implemented: However, many still believe that the plan is merely an empty slogan and will remain skeptical until we actually implement it. ?]

@rally_local
title: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        if (Q.kpd_wtb_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.wtb_implemented <= Q.kpd_wtb_rally || !Q.kpd_in_government)) {
            return false;
        } else if (Q.kpd_in_government && !Q.nazi_peak_triggered) {
            return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        if (Q.return_to_normalcy) {
            return false;
        } else if (Q.socializations <= 0) {
            return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The KPD's speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
